  "description": "[\"Must marry or die within a year.\"] \n\nDue to his family's blind belief in a prophecy, cold-blooded prosecutor Woo-jae is forced to go on a blind date with Yeon-su, an actor from a failed idol group. However, they leave each other with the worst possible impression, and the matchmaking falls apart. \n\nMonths later, a massive prostitution scandal shakes South Korea, and Woo-jae finds himself facing Yeon-su as the prosecutor in charge of her case as a suspect. \n\nYet, somehow, this woman seems to have been framed?! \n\nAn fated contract marriage between an ultra-logical 'T' man and an ultra-emotional 'F' woman. \n\nWill these two truly be able to find their romantic destiny?!\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12272368), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12816675) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=855642), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14767056)",
